      "tags": ["assertiveness"]
    },
    {
      "id": "envy-ignorance-imitation-suicide",
      "text": "Envy is ignorance; that imitation is suicide; that he must take himself for better for worse as his portion.",
      "section": "self-reliance",
      "locator": "Self-Reliance",
      "tags": ["self-development"]
    },
    {
